    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049457
  - m_Id: 1501152927868
    m_Localized: no data
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049458
  - m_Id: 1501152927869
    m_Localized: not specified
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049459
  - m_Id: 1501152927870
    m_Localized: Copy relationship not confirmed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049460
  - m_Id: 1501152927871
    m_Localized: Yes, delete world
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049461
  - m_Id: 1501152927872
    m_Localized: 'Could not modify the save: '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049462
  - m_Id: 1501152927873
    m_Localized: "Saving changes\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049463
  - m_Id: 1501152927874
    m_Localized: "Delete \u201C{0}\u201D (world {1}) and all its local branches?\nA
      copy will remain in DeletedWorlds. The character will be kept."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049464
  - m_Id: 1501152927875
    m_Localized: Select a place on the map.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049465
  - m_Id: 1501152927878
    m_Localized: "Factory number must be an integer from \u2212{0} to {1}."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049466
  - m_Id: 1501152927879
    m_Localized: "\n\nWaiting for travel confirmation\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049467
  - m_Id: 1501152927880
    m_Localized: Travel to the factory entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049468
  - m_Id: 1501152927881
    m_Localized: "Main factory \xB7 0"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049469
  - m_Id: 1501152927882
    m_Localized: '


      Not visited yet: it will be generated on first entry.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049470
  - m_Id: 1501152927883
    m_Localized: '


      Visited: '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049471
  - m_Id: 1501152927884
    m_Localized: Saved copy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049472
  - m_Id: 1501152927885
    m_Localized: There are no saved worlds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049473
  - m_Id: 1501152927886
    m_Localized: "Reading world list\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049474
  - m_Id: 1501152927887
    m_Localized: 'Could not select the world: the save is unavailable or damaged.

      See
      the game log for details. You can select another world.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049475
  - m_Id: 1501152927888
    m_Localized: "Checking and selecting save\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049476
  - m_Id: 1501152927889
    m_Localized: Could not read the world list. See the game log for details.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049477
  - m_Id: 1501152927890
    m_Localized: The list was built with warnings. See the game log for details.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049478
  - m_Id: 1501152927891
    m_Localized: no data
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049479
  - m_Id: 1501152927892
    m_Localized: Now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049480
  - m_Id: 1501152927893
    m_Localized: In save
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049481
  - m_Id: 1501152927894
    m_Localized: Try loading with this set
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049482
  - m_Id: 1501152927895
    m_Localized: Select an action and press a key. Esc cancels the selection and
      closes the window.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049483
  - m_Id: 3325389955075
    m_Localized: Could not load the location. Session stopped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841079933049484
  - m_Id: 605741592338432
    m_Localized: Ordinary factory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841097912975401
  - m_Id: 605741688807424
    m_Localized: 'An abandoned factory: each room has its own inhabitants.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841097912975402
  - m_Id: 605741688807425
    m_Localized: Raider-occupied
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841097912975403
  - m_Id: 605741688807426
    m_Localized: A gang has settled in the workshops. Raiders occupy almost every
      room, and many carry firearms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841097912975404
  - m_Id: 605741688807427
    m_Localized: Untouched
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841097912975405
  - m_Id: 605741688807428
    m_Localized: Almost no one has reached this place. Bots and turrets still guard
      the workshops.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841097912975406
  - m_Id: 605741688807429
    m_Localized: Infested
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841097912975407
  - m_Id: 605741688807430
    m_Localized: 'The factory belongs to creatures: zombies, slimes and insects instead
      of people and machines.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4666841097912975408
